":314.829,"line":97},{"w":"force","s":314.829,"e":315.084,"line":97},{"w":"for","s":315.084,"e":315.339,"line":97},{"w":"freedom","s":315.339,"e":315.849,"line":97},{"w":"When","s":314.38,"e":314.46,"line":98},{"w":"belief","s":314.38,"e":314.46,"line":98},{"w":"becomes","s":314.38,"e":314.46,"line":98},{"w":"a","s":314.38,"e":314.46,"line":98},{"w":"deed.","s":314.38,"e":314.46,"line":98}],"lines":[{"s":20.32,"e":21.85,"text":"# **The Least Pay the Most**"},{"s":21.85,"e":22.75,"text":"**[Intro]**"},{"s":22.75,"e":26.066,"text":"They built a brutal business where the broke pay more,"},{"s":26.066,"e":29.381,"text":"Then boast about the Bible from a gold-trimmed floor."},{"s":29.381,"e":32.952,"text":"They praise a peaceful Prophet, then profit from the poor—"},{"s":32.952,"e":36.267,"text":"Preaching grace on Sunday, Monday guarding greed’s front door."},{"s":36.267,"e":37.167,"text":"**[Verse 1]**"},{"s":37.167,"e":40.228,"text":"Balance barely breathing, bank account in red,"},{"s":40.228,"e":43.798,"text":"Bankers bite another fee from money already dead."},{"s":43.798,"e":47.369,"text":"Five dollars in the negative, thirty-five gets drained,"},{"s":47.369,"e":51.194,"text":"Poverty gets punished while the profit gets proclaimed."},{"s":51.194,"e":53.235,"text":"Bills bounce badly, penalties pile,"},{"s":53.235,"e":55.275,"text":"Fees breed fees in a fatal file."},{"s":55.275,"e":57.825,"text":"Paycheck posts late, but the landlord won’t wait,"},{"s":57.825,"e":61.396,"text":"So the poor pay a premium for arriving past the date."},{"s":61.396,"e":64.201,"text":"Credit costs the most when you need it to cope,"},{"s":64.201,"e":67.517,"text":"Payday lenders package desperation up as hope."},{"s":67.517,"e":71.087,"text":"The wealthy win low rates and lock their wealth in stores;"},{"s":71.087,"e":74.658,"text":"Workers borrow just to keep some supper in the drawers."},{"s":74.658,"e":75.558,"text":"**[Pre-Chorus]**"},{"s":75.558,"e":78.874,"text":"Every office offers obstacles and demands,"},{"s":78.874,"e":82.444,"text":"Every lifeline leaves a ledger in your hands."},{"s":82.444,"e":86.27,"text":"They swear the system’s equal since the statutes stay the same,"},{"s":86.27,"e":89.585,"text":"But a spark costs more when you’re already in the flame."},{"s":89.585,"e":90.485,"text":"**[Chorus]**"},{"s":90.485,"e":92.525,"text":"The least pay the most, coast to coast,"},{"s":92.525,"e":95.331,"text":"For a room, a ride, the right to stay afloat."},{"s":95.331,"e":97.881,"text":"Banks take bites and the DMV takes days,"},{"s":97.881,"e":101.962,"text":"Every system sells survival in a hundred hidden ways."},{"s":101.962,"e":104.767,"text":"They quote Christ clearly, then contradict His call,"},{"s":104.767,"e":108.083,"text":"Sing about the Savior while the starving scrape the wall."},{"s":108.083,"e":111.908,"text":"One penny from the poor holds more than fortunes from the rich,"},{"s":111.908,"e":115.479,"text":"Still churches cheer the wealthy while the poor stay in the ditch."},{"s":115.479,"e":116.379,"text":"**[Verse 2]**"},{"s":116.379,"e":119.95,"text":"Need a car for the career, need the career for the car,"},{"s":119.95,"e":123.01,"text":"Need a license from an office painfully far."},{"s":123.01,"e":126.836,"text":"Miss a morning making money, spend the afternoon in line,"},{"s":126.836,"e":130.661,"text":"Government grabs your wages while it wastes away your time."},{"s":130.661,"e":133.977,"text":"Booked back in April, still you wait into the night,"},{"s":133.977,"e":137.292,"text":"Bring a birth certificate—they claim it isn’t right."},{"s":137.292,"e":140.608,"text":"One box blank, back you go, brokenhearted through the door,"},{"s":140.608,"e":143.413,"text":"The DMV keeps demonstrating: poor folks pay more."},{"s":143.413,"e":146.474,"text":"No paid leave, so you labor while your lungs burn sick,"},{"s":146.474,"e":149.534,"text":"Lose one shift and eviction starts to count down quick."},{"s":149.534,"e":152.85,"text":"Can’t afford the clinic, so the sickness settles deep,"},{"s":152.85,"e":156.675,"text":"Then the ambulance adds anguish with a bill you cannot beat."},{"s":156.675,"e":159.736,"text":"Cheap shoes crack quickly, so you purchase pair on pair,"},{"s":159.736,"e":163.051,"text":"Cheap meals ease the hunger while they slowly strip your health."},{"s":163.051,"e":166.622,"text":"The rich buy quality once; the poor replace and replace,"},{"s":166.622,"e":170.192,"text":"Then society scolds the struggling with a shameless face."},{"s":170.192,"e":171.092,"text":"**[Chorus]**"},{"s":171.092,"e":173.133,"text":"The least pay the most, coast to coast,"},{"s":173.133,"e":176.193,"text":"For a meal, medicine, a modest bit of hope."},{"s":176.193,"e":178.743,"text":"Courts collect cash and the DMV takes days,"},{"s":178.743,"e":182.824,"text":"Every system sells survival in a hundred hidden ways."},{"s":182.824,"e":185.629,"text":"They quote Christ clearly, then contradict His call,"},{"s":185.629,"e":188.945,"text":"Build enormous temples while their neighbors beg and crawl."},{"s":188.945,"e":192.005,"text":"One penny from the poor holds sacrifice within;"},{"s":192.005,"e":195.321,"text":"One dollar from abundance doesn’t wash away your sin."},{"s":195.321,"e":196.221,"text":"**[Bridge]**"},{"s":196.221,"e":199.792,"text":"You memorize the message, mark the margins, quote the page,"},{"s":199.792,"e":203.362,"text":"Then ignore the aching people crushed beneath the weight."},{"s":203.362,"e":206.933,"text":"You raise your hands to heaven, sing salvation sweet and loud,"},{"s":206.933,"e":210.503,"text":"Then pass a freezing person like a shadow in the crowd."},{"s":210.503,"e":214.584,"text":"You know each sacred sentence, every sermon, every song,"},{"s":214.584,"e":218.154,"text":"But faith without fair action is a fraud that funds the wrong."},{"s":218.154,"e":221.725,"text":"You say the meek are mighty, say the last will lead the first,"},{"s":221.725,"e":225.805,"text":"Then maintain the very machines that make their misery worse."},{"s":225.805,"e":229.631,"text":"Banks benefit from brokenness, courts capitalize on fate,"},{"s":229.631,"e":233.202,"text":"Landlords leverage hunger, leaders manufacture hate."},{"s":233.202,"e":236.517,"text":"The danger isn’t distant; it is printed on the fee,"},{"s":236.517,"e":239.833,"text":"Glowing green above the counter at the local DMV."},{"s":239.833,"e":240.733,"text":"**[Breakdown]**"},{"s":240.733,"e":243.028,"text":"Thirty-five because you lacked five—"},{"s":243.028,"e":245.323,"text":"They call that keeping banking alive."},{"s":245.323,"e":247.364,"text":"Late rent fee because rent was late—"},{"s":247.364,"e":249.914,"text":"They deepen the ditch, then debate your fate."},{"s":249.914,"e":253.74,"text":"But people pressed together can pressure every wall,"},{"s":253.74,"e":257.31,"text":"A thousand steady voices can outshout one marble hall."},{"s":257.31,"e":260.626,"text":"Mercy made into policy, dignity made law—"},{"s":260.626,"e":264.451,"text":"We can build a better system than the broken one we saw."},{"s":264.451,"e":265.471,"text":"**[Final Chorus]**"},{"s":265.471,"e":268.277,"text":"The least pay the most—but we won’t anymore,"},{"s":268.277,"e":271.592,"text":"We’ll bring the buried burden to the public’s front door."},{"s":271.592,"e":273.888,"text":"Banks took bites and the DMV took days,"},{"s":273.888,"e":278.223,"text":"Now we’re naming every punishment and changing every way."},{"s":278.223,"e":281.794,"text":"Stop quoting Christ as camouflage for coldness and control,"},{"s":281.794,"e":285.875,"text":"Start feeding every body, start protecting every soul."},{"s":285.875,"e":289.19,"text":"That penny from the poor is a precious piece of breath;"},{"s":289.19,"e":293.016,"text":"Let compassion become practice, not a promise after death."},{"s":293.016,"e":296.841,"text":"The world may stand in peril, but the people still have power,"},{"s":296.841,"e":301.177,"text":"Every hand can help a neighbor, every voice can move the hour."},{"s":301.177,"e":305.002,"text":"When mercy matters more than every margin, fee, and score,"},{"s":305.002,"e":308.828,"text":"The people with the least won’t have to pay the most anymore."},{"s":308.828,"e":309.728,"text":"**[Outro]**"},{"s":309.728,"e":311.768,"text":"Read the Scripture, live the meaning."},{"s":311.768,"e":313.554,"text":"Feed the hungry, fight the greed."},{"s":313.554,"e":315.849,"text":"Faith becomes a force for freedom"},{"s":314.38,"e":314.46,"text":"When belief becomes a deed."}],"duration":327.2,"source":"curated-realigned","generatedAt":"2026-08-21T00:55:14.119Z","realignedFrom":"whisper-aligned","vocalStart":20.32,"vocalEnd":314.38}